 ### Pattern 2: Fixtures for Setup and Teardown
+
+A yield fixture's post-yield teardown is not reached if its setup fails before
+yield. Register cleanup immediately after each acquisition or use a context
+manager/ExitStack for partial acquisition. Test failed setup as well as failed
+bodies; use narrow scopes unless shared state has a demonstrated contract.
+See [pytest fixture teardown](https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/fixtures.html#teardown-cleanup-aka-fixture-finalization).
 
